{
  "project_id": 20,
  "project_label": "gemma",
  "task_id": 7325,
  "title": "The Airstream, restyled",
  "author": "Christopher C. Deam",
  "url": "https://www.ted.com/talks/christopher_c_deam_the_airstream_restyled",
  "annotation_id": null,
  "completed_by": 7,
  "created_at": "2026-05-07T03:30:56.050539Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-05-07T03:30:56.050539Z",
  "lead_time": 38.946,
  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 258,
        "text": "I was asked by Wilsonart International, a plastic laminate company, which is the largest plastic laminate company in the world -- they asked me to design a trade show booth for exhibition at the International Contemporary Furniture Fair in New York, in 2000.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6368522641",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 266,
        "endOffset": 294,
        "text": "fresh, new contemporary look",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6EA13310A1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 295,
        "text": "So looking at their three main markets for their product which were basically transportation design, interiors and furniture, we came up with the solution of taking an old Airstream trailer and gutting it, and trying to portray laminate, and a trailer, in kind of a fresh, new contemporary look.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "18BCC319DB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 130,
        "text": "When this trailer showed up at my shop in Berkeley, I'd actually never stepped foot in an Airstream trailer, or any other trailer.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AF48A433D1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 48,
        "endOffset": 73,
        "text": "totally fresh perspective",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1F926FA33A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 134,
        "text": "So I can be somebody that can look at this in a totally fresh perspective and see if I can optimize it in its most idealistic fashion.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D468E8B13C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 119,
        "text": "I decided I had to do some research and really figure out what had gone wrong somewhere along the history of Airstream.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DDB5E1DB46",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 139,
        "text": "What I discovered in these interiors is that there was a disconnect between the exterior shell and the interior architecture of the pieces.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E5FA19433F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 182,
        "text": "In that the shell was originally conceived as a lightweight, modern, futuristic, high-tech pod for hurtling down the freeway, and the interiors were completely out of sync with that.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BB8DAEE873",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 43,
        "endOffset": 57,
        "text": "mountain cabin",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6AB7334044",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 26,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "crisis",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "345818F5DF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 100,
        "endOffset": 139,
        "text": "escape, and about travel, and modernity",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0F85745CC2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 191,
        "text": "That seemed really like a crisis to me, that they had never been able to develop a vocabulary about escape, and about travel, and modernity in this trailer that was consistent with the shell.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "614A10C6EF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 64,
        "endOffset": 168,
        "text": "figure out what's authentic in an Airstream trailer, and what feels like it has true purpose and utility",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2C62F73BA9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 169,
        "text": "We really needed to do some archeology in the trailer itself to figure out what's authentic in an Airstream trailer, and what feels like it has true purpose and utility.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D76D238BC7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 105,
        "text": "We stripped out all the vinyl and zolatone paint that was covering up this just fantastic aluminum shell.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "92598E5D49",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 93,
        "text": "We took off all the visible hardware and trim that was kind of doing the country cabin thing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "83A30F239D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 149,
        "text": "I literally drew on the walls of the trailer, mocked it up in cardboard, we'd come in and cut, decide things were wrong, pull it out, put it back in.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "226E1CFEB3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 21,
        "endOffset": 109,
        "text": "smooth out the interior, and begin to speak about motion, and mobility, and independence",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D854A2F398",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 110,
        "text": "The main goal was to smooth out the interior, and begin to speak about motion, and mobility, and independence.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1C16A6338F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 186,
        "text": "The biggest difficulty on one of these trailers is that when you're designing there's actually no logical place to stop and start materials because of the continuous form of the trailer.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "193CECB01F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 109,
        "text": "There's no such things as two walls and a ceiling coming together, where you can change materials and shapes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C405D66C2F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 27,
        "text": "So that became a challenge.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "71BBDC202B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 16,
        "text": "Compounding that",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EDCF8EE7D7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 18,
        "endOffset": 113,
        "text": "the material of choice, laminate, that I was trying to highlight, only bends in two dimensions.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "235863BB85",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 31,
        "text": "It's a compound curve interior.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C26B786262",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 34,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "fooling the eye",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3604D00862",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 50,
        "endOffset": 113,
        "text": "into believing that all these panels are curved with the shell.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EF3C982868",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 94,
        "text": "What I came up with was a series of second skins that basically float over the aluminum shell.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2D7344AA78",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 38,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "direct your eye",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "419B2ABEF4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 178,
        "text": "And what I was trying to do there was in the space, so that you would perceive the geometry in a different way, and that the casework wouldn't break up the space.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D8CED69C7B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 130,
        "text": "They also gave us a way to run power and rewire the trailer without tearing out the skin, so they function as an electrical chase.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D75F3DB96C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "That's the trailer, pretty much finished.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C6C1CC15EA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 93,
        "text": "That trailer led to another commission, to participate in whats called Tokyo Designers Block.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CE6A8E1479",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "Its a week of furniture design events in Tokyo, in October.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1DE9339069",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 104,
        "text": "Teruo Kurosaki, who owns a furniture company called Idee, he asked me to ship him two trailers to Tokyo.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7D39F611BC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 90,
        "text": "He said one he would like to make a real trailer, functioning, and we would sell that one.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "08836F2BBD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 73,
        "text": "Trailer number two, you have a blank slate, you can to anything you want.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "22C94772FB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 115,
        "text": "We came up with a fantasy scenario of a DJ traveling around the States, that would collect records and go on tours.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "76EF4F8129",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 84,
        "text": "This trailer housed two turntables, mixer, wet bar, fridge, integrated sound system.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F9C4ED57B8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 94,
        "text": "It's got a huge couch, fits quite a few people, and basically we'd had a great time with this.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4BE027F56C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 106,
        "text": "And so in this trailer I took it upon myself to think about travel, and escape, in an idiosyncratic sense.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D2A470F89B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 73,
        "text": "A lot of these ideas migrated into the production trailers for Airstream.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D5FD8FB7F1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 69,
        "text": "This brings us up to the time that I started consulting to Airstream.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2DCB54F03B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 73,
        "text": "They came to me and said, \"Well, what can we do to freshen this thing up?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A553084239",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 95,
        "text": "And do you think kids, you know, skateboarders, surfers, rock climbers, would use these things?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6B40F2B1DB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "And I said, \"Well, not in that interior.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F623905B35",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Laughter)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BBB6E2F969",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 114,
        "text": "I thought, \"Finally, oh yeah great, big company, I'm gonna work with somebody with money for tooling and molding.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "70319D832A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 112,
        "text": "And I walked in their prototype facility, and it's exactly like my shop, only bigger -- same tools, same things.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6F12084018",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 177,
        "text": "So the problem became -- and they set this dilemma to me -- that you have to design the interior using only our existing technology, and there's no money for tooling or molding.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EB36A3377E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
